\title{openhexa: R Client for the 'OpenHEXA' Data Platform}
\description{
Work with 'OpenHEXA' workspaces from R: read and publish datasets, read and write workspace files, run saved queries, publish web apps, create notebooks, connect to the workspace database and external connections (DHIS2, IASO, PostgreSQL, S3, GCS), and run pipelines. Talks to the 'OpenHEXA' 'GraphQL' API.
